keywords:
  - near-inertial
  - mixed layer
  - slab model
  - transfer function
  - Green function
  - velocity-gradient tensor
  - oceanography
abstract: >-
  Educational Python for a slab mixed-layer model with a two-dimensional full
  horizontal velocity-gradient tensor. Implements the transfer function H
  (equations 12-16) and Green function G (equations 17-22), and redraws
  manuscript Figures 2 and 3.
